@startuml
title liblevenshtein CLI — application and dependency boundary
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam defaultFontColor #102027

actor "Command user" as user #D1C4E9
component "liblevenshtein executable\nsrc/main.rs" as binary #90CAF9
component "CLI + REPL coordination\nsrc/cli · src/repl · src/commands" as app #64B5F6
component "File ingestion adapters\ncompression · archives · documents · OCR" as adapters #FFCC80
component "liblevenshtein\nautomata · distance · phonetic matching" as core #A5D6A7
component "libdictenstein\ndictionary backends · persistence" as dict #81C784
database "Dictionary and config files" as files #FFF59D
collections "Untrusted input files" as inputs #FFAB91

user --> binary : operation flags or REPL commands
binary --> app : run()
app --> core : construct and execute matchers
app --> dict : load, query, mutate, save
app --> adapters : request decoded text
adapters --> inputs : bounded reads
app --> files : explicit read/write
core --> dict : traverse Dictionary traits

note bottom of core
  Reusable library boundary:
  no dependency on the CLI crate
  or application-only adapters
end note
@enduml
